<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Louisiana Housing Agency.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Louisiana Housing Agency.</headline>
<text>
<p>LOUISIANA HOUSING FINANCE AGENCY</p>
<p>RE: $85,275,000</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>Effective at 9:30 A.M. E.S.T., Friday, March 14, 1997 all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
